Feature: Homeowners Surplus Coherent InforceSheet

  Scenario Outline:  HS - FL - "<TC_ID>" - New Business
  As a user I want to be able to create a quote with converted InforceSheet data

    Given I have entered test data for test case "<TC_ID>" in excel workbook "coherent/QuoteCreationInforceHS_FL" in sheet "QuoteCreatorHS" for "HS" LOB

    When I am logged in to Pure as Zonal
    * I set "Effective_Date" to "03/01/2025"
    * I load random user data
    * I navigate to quotes page
    * I initiate a new quote
    * I get customer account ID
#    * I edit customer insurance score
    * I open quote under customer
    * I navigate to quotes detail page
    * I create a new "HS" quote
    * I navigate to Optional Coverages Page
    * I select "No" for "Do you wish to include excess flood coverage?" on "Optional Coverages"
    * I set Primary Flood Dec Page Received to "No"
    * I navigate to "Risk Model Information" page through the Tree
    * I click save changes button
    * I rate a quote

    Then I save the Location premium in Excel "src/test/test_data/dragon/coherent/FL_HS_Testing_Data.xlsx" in sheet "Results" for "<TC_ID>" "<state>" and policy number "<policyNum>" with expected premium "<expectedPremium>"

